ins/a21286d2-e480-4e8e-af66-d412b163203c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34c766f2de1a96e8fc114bbedfd36b73 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello, nice to meet you. I really like your Artwork that's why I would like to request some from you.\n Characters: Minamoto no Raikou from FGO Boudica from FGO Barghest from FGO\nSituation: The girls have lost the fight against the tentacle demon from your 異形交尾快楽地獄 work. The tentacles would train their bodies while fucking them. They would tease, milk their breasts, modify their body over time, and would make them submit. Please add some differences to the image like: bigger breasts, pregnant, ahegao, giving birth", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lealorg/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3eb3b213/uploads/origins/de1a7647-0fd0-4d20-8c85-38239c43cc1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c51eb1c335fac3c57b0b1cf75048f0e4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3eb3b213/uploads/origins/de1a7647-0fd0-4d20-8c85-38239c43cc1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c51eb1c335fac3c57b0b1cf75048f0e4, https://si.imgix.net/3eb3b213/uploads/origins/de1a7647-0fd0-4d20-8c85-38239c43cc1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5788636d7a80ce0a1067fcf7b7f7ac7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3eb3b213/uploads/origins/de1a7647-0fd0-4d20-8c85-38239c43cc1b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=966872ee483e58978a707ea38783e15b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "対魔忍ふうま時子AVデビュー\n\nお館様（主人公）を人質に取られた時子がAV出演を強要され、手練のAV男優に成す術もなくイカされまくる。\n責め方や衣装はおまかせします。\n自己紹介シーンもあると嬉しいです。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@lealorg/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b0467fd9/uploads/origins/724a616e-101e-411a-a448-2220313f506b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px